msgid "# Disaggregated Encoder with Mooncake on Ascend"
msgstr "# 在昇腾上使用 Mooncake 的分离式编码器"

msgid ""
"`ECMooncakeConnector` transfers multimodal encoder outputs from an Encoder\n"
"instance (E) to a language-model instance running prefill and decode (PD).\n"
"Separating these stages lets you scale vision encoding independently of the\n"
"language model. With cross-Encoder caching enabled, Encoders can also reuse\n"
"image embeddings through a shared Mooncake Store."
msgstr ""
"`ECMooncakeConnector` "
"将多模态编码器输出从编码器实例（E）传输到运行预填充和解码（PD）的语言模型实例。分离这些阶段可以让您独立于语言模型扩展视觉编码。启用跨编码器缓存后，编码器还可以通过共享的"
" Mooncake Store 复用图像嵌入。"

msgid ""
"This guide provides separate **A2/RoCE** and **A3/HCCS with FabricMem**\n"
"transport setups. Choose the setup for your hardware, start a single-host\n"
"**1E + 1PD** service, then add shared caching and a second Encoder. The serving\n"
"commands use the `ascend` Mooncake protocol in both setups."
msgstr ""
"本指南提供了独立的 **A2/RoCE** 和 **A3/HCCS 配合 FabricMem** 传输配置。请为您的硬件选择合适的配置，启动单机 "
"**1E + 1PD** 服务，然后添加共享缓存和第二个编码器。两种配置中的服务命令均使用 `ascend` Mooncake 协议。"

msgid "## Deployment overview"
msgstr "## 部署概览"

msgid ""
"With caching enabled, Encoders GET embeddings from Store and encode on a\n"
"miss, then publish through asynchronous PUT. Both cached and newly encoded\n"
"outputs reach PD through EC P2P. Store is a shared cache for the Encoders;\n"
"it does not forward requests between the proxy and PD."
msgstr ""
"启用缓存后，编码器从 Store 获取（GET）嵌入，在未命中时进行编码，然后通过异步 PUT 发布。缓存的和新编码的输出都通过 EC P2P 到达 "
"PD。Store 是编码器的共享缓存；它不会在代理和 PD 之间转发请求。"

msgid "## Requirements"
msgstr "## 环境要求"

msgid "For cross-Encoder caching:"
msgstr "对于跨编码器缓存："

msgid ""
"- Install Mooncake with Ascend Store support and run a RAM Store with\n"
"  `mooncake_master`.\n"
"- Leave multimodal processor caching enabled (the default) to preserve content\n"
"  identifiers.\n"
"- Use the same immutable weights, compatible preprocessing, and matching\n"
"  multimodal identifiers on participating Encoders.\n"
"- Do not enable LoRA; the current connector rejects LoRA configurations."
msgstr ""
"- 安装支持昇腾 Store 的 Mooncake，并使用 `mooncake_master` 运行 RAM Store。\n"
"- 保持多模态处理器缓存启用（默认值）以保留内容标识符。\n"
"- 在参与的编码器上使用相同的不可变权重、兼容的预处理和匹配的多模态标识符。\n"
"- 不要启用 LoRA；当前连接器会拒绝 LoRA 配置。"

msgid "## Hardware, connectivity, and software"
msgstr "## 硬件、连接和软件"

msgid ""
"Choose the communication path independently from the number of Store "
"engines:"
msgstr "独立于 Store 引擎数量选择通信路径："

msgid "| Environment | EC embeddings, E to PD | Store access |"
msgstr "| 环境 | EC 嵌入，E 到 PD | Store 访问 |"

msgid ""
"| A2 | Ascend Direct RoCE | Non-FabricMem RoCE, shared or independent Store "
"engine |"
msgstr "| A2 | Ascend Direct RoCE | 非 FabricMem RoCE，共享或独立 Store 引擎 |"

msgid ""
"| A3 within a supported HCCS domain | Ordinary HCCS device-to-device "
"transfer | FabricMem access to Store Host memory over the supported fabric |"
msgstr ""
"| 受支持 HCCS 域内的 A3 | 普通 HCCS 设备到设备传输 | 通过受支持的 fabric 以 FabricMem 访问 Store "
"Host 内存 |"

msgid ""
"| A3 with an operational RoCE network | Ascend Direct RoCE | Non-FabricMem "
"RoCE |"
msgstr "| 具有可用 RoCE 网络的 A3 | Ascend Direct RoCE | 非 FabricMem RoCE |"

msgid ""
"Confirm the actual server/product, visible device mapping, and interconnect.\n"
"FabricMem is a Host-memory access mechanism on supported platforms. Ordinary\n"
"HCCS device transfer alone does not give a Store access to remote Host memory.\n"
"A2 does not support the mixed **EC/HCCS + Store/RoCE** configuration in this\n"
"connector. A5 (Atlas 950) has not yet been tested or adapted for this EC Store\n"
"integration."
msgstr ""
"确认实际的服务器/产品、可见设备映射和互连方式。FabricMem 是受支持平台上的 Host 内存访问机制。仅靠普通 HCCS 设备传输并不能让 "
"Store 访问远程 Host 内存。A2 不支持此连接器中的混合 **EC/HCCS + Store/RoCE** 配置。A5（Atlas "
"950）尚未针对此 EC Store 集成进行测试或适配。"

msgid ""
"Use the [Ascend compatibility table](kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#hdk-and-cann-version-compatibility-reference)\n"
"for the installed hardware and software. For FabricMem, Mooncake additionally\n"
"requires supported A3 hardware, CANN 9.0+, and HDK 26.0+; see its\n"
"[Ascend Direct requirements](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/blob/main/docs/source/design/transfer-engine/transport/ascend_direct_transport.md#environment-variables-configuration).\n"
"These communication requirements apply to both embedded and standalone Store."
msgstr ""
"请使用 [昇腾兼容性表](kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#hdk-and-cann-version-"
"compatibility-reference) 查看已安装的硬件和软件。对于 FabricMem，Mooncake 还要求受支持的 A3 "
"硬件、CANN 9.0+ 和 HDK 26.0+；请参阅其 [Ascend Direct 要求](https://github.com/kvcache-"
"ai/Mooncake/blob/main/docs/source/design/transfer-"
"engine/transport/ascend_direct_transport.md#environment-variables-"
"configuration)。这些通信要求适用于嵌入式 Store 和独立 Store。"

msgid "Before serving:"
msgstr "在启动服务之前："

msgid ""
"1. Inspect `npu-smi info` and the device mapping available inside the container.\n"
"   `ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES` must use the device identifiers accepted by that\n"
"   installation; do not assume host physical IDs equal process-local IDs.\n"
"2. For RoCE, check each selected device's IP, link, and peer reachability with\n"
"   `hccn_tool` and the [A2/A3 communication checks](../../tutorials/features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md#verify-multi-node-communication-environment).\n"
"3. For HCCS/FabricMem, verify the fabric domain, device visibility, permissions,\n"
"   and the A3 communication checks. A missing RoCE IP does not by itself rule\n"
"   out HCCS/FabricMem. Conversely, topology output showing HCCS does not verify\n"
"   Host-memory allocation or mapping.\n"
"4. Mount the devices, driver libraries, configuration files such as\n"
"   `/etc/hccn.conf`, and network resources required by the chosen path, following\n"
"   the [container guide](../../tutorials/features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md#run-with-docker).\n"
"   Keep the driver, userspace libraries, and Mooncake build compatible."
msgstr ""
"1. 检查 `npu-smi info` 以及容器内可用的设备映射。`ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES` 必须使用该安装所接受的设备标识符；不要假设主机物理 ID 等于进程本地 ID。\n"
"2. 对于 RoCE，使用 `hccn_tool` 和 [A2/A3 通信检查](../../tutorials/features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md#verify-multi-node-communication-environment) 检查每个所选设备的 IP、链路和对端可达性。\n"
"3. 对于 HCCS/FabricMem，验证 fabric 域、设备可见性、权限以及 A3 通信检查。缺少 RoCE IP 本身并不能排除 HCCS/FabricMem。反之，显示 HCCS 的拓扑输出也不能验证 Host 内存分配或映射。\n"
"4. 按照 [容器指南](../../tutorials/features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md#run-with-docker) 挂载所选路径所需的设备、驱动库、配置文件（如 `/etc/hccn.conf`）和网络资源。保持驱动、用户态库和 Mooncake 构建版本兼容。"

msgid ""
"The connector leaves `HCCL_INTRA_PCIE_ENABLE`, `HCCL_INTRA_ROCE_ENABLE`,\n"
"`ASCEND_GLOBAL_RESOURCE_CONFIG`, and `ASCEND_ENABLE_USE_FABRIC_MEM` unchanged.\n"
"Configure them before starting each process; restarting a service is required\n"
"when changing transport. Do not change selectors between EC and Store engine\n"
"creation inside a running worker."
msgstr ""
"该连接器不会更改 "
"`HCCL_INTRA_PCIE_ENABLE`、`HCCL_INTRA_ROCE_ENABLE`、`ASCEND_GLOBAL_RESOURCE_CONFIG`"
" 和 `ASCEND_ENABLE_USE_FABRIC_MEM`。请在启动每个进程之前配置它们；更改传输方式时需要重启服务。不要在运行中的 "
"worker 内于 EC 和 Store 引擎创建之间更改选择器。"

msgid "## 1. Prepare the serving environment"
msgstr "## 1. 准备服务环境"

msgid "The example uses E on NPU 0, PD on NPU 1, and these ports:"
msgstr "示例在 NPU 0 上使用 E，在 NPU 1 上使用 PD，并使用以下端口："

msgid "| Service | Address |"
msgstr "| 服务 | 地址 |"

msgid "| Encoder HTTP | `127.0.0.1:19534` |"
msgstr "| 编码器 HTTP | `127.0.0.1:19534` |"

msgid "| PD HTTP | `127.0.0.1:19537` |"
msgstr "| PD HTTP | `127.0.0.1:19537` |"

msgid "| PD EC reservation/control | `tcp://127.0.0.1:19019` |"
msgstr "| PD EC 预留/控制 | `tcp://127.0.0.1:19019` |"

msgid "| EPD proxy HTTP | `127.0.0.1:10002` |"
msgstr "| EPD 代理 HTTP | `127.0.0.1:10002` |"

msgid "| Optional Store master | `127.0.0.1:50051` |"
msgstr "| 可选 Store master | `127.0.0.1:50051` |"

msgid ""
"Run this environment setup in each serving terminal. Use the same configured\n"
"model path or identifier on E and PD:"
msgstr "在每个服务终端中运行此环境设置。在 E 和 PD 上使用相同的已配置模型路径或标识符："

msgid "### A2: EC and Store over RoCE"
msgstr "### A2：EC 与 Store 基于 RoCE"

msgid "In every Encoder and PD terminal:"
msgstr "在每个 Encoder 和 PD 终端中："

msgid ""
"This selects the shared EC/Store engine path when caching is enabled. PD uses\n"
"its own EC receive engine; it does not become a Store client. Keep the selectors\n"
"on both roles for the lifetime of their processes: successful engine creation\n"
"alone does not establish that later HCCL channel creation will use the same path."
msgstr ""
"启用缓存时，这会选择共享的 EC/Store 引擎路径。PD 使用自己的 EC 接收引擎；它不会成为 Store "
"客户端。在两个角色的整个进程生命周期内都要保持这些选择器：仅凭引擎创建成功并不能保证后续 HCCL 通道创建会使用相同的路径。"

msgid ""
"For an **independent Store RoCE engine**, use the same selectors and additionally\n"
"set this on each Encoder before starting it:"
msgstr "对于**独立的 Store RoCE 引擎**，使用相同的选择器，并在启动每个 Encoder 之前额外设置以下内容："

msgid "Set the matching top-level EC configuration on PD:"
msgstr "在 PD 上设置匹配的顶层 EC 配置："

msgid ""
"The top level selects EC resources; the `store` object selects the Store-owned\n"
"engine's resources. A separate engine does not create an independent network\n"
"or imply that mixed HCCS/RoCE works on A2."
msgstr ""
"顶层选择 EC 资源；`store` 对象选择 Store 自有引擎的资源。独立引擎不会创建独立的网络，也不意味着混合 HCCS/RoCE 在 A2 "
"上可用。"

msgid "### A3: EC over HCCS, Store over FabricMem"
msgstr "### A3：EC 基于 HCCS，Store 基于 FabricMem"

msgid ""
"Within a supported HCCS/FabricMem domain, replace the RoCE setup with the\n"
"following in every Encoder and PD terminal:"
msgstr "在受支持的 HCCS/FabricMem 域内，在每个 Encoder 和 PD 终端中用以下内容替换 RoCE 设置："

msgid ""
"EC uses ordinary Ascend HCCS device transfers. On a caching Encoder, Store\n"
"creates its own FabricMem engine and owns the Host storage segment; it does\n"
"not reuse the EC engine. PD needs HCCS reachability for EC reception and does\n"
"not need a Store client. FabricMem applies to the Store engine, so enabling it\n"
"does not turn the EC payload path into a Host Store operation."
msgstr ""
"EC 使用普通的昇腾 HCCS 设备传输。在启用缓存的 Encoder 上，Store 会创建自己的 FabricMem 引擎并拥有 Host "
"存储段；它不会复用 EC 引擎。PD 需要 HCCS 可达性以接收 EC，且不需要 Store 客户端。FabricMem 仅适用于 Store "
"引擎，因此启用它不会将 EC 载荷路径变为 Host Store 操作。"

msgid ""
"This is the A3 HCCS/FabricMem setup described in the\n"
"[Ascend Store guide](kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-1-mooncake-backend).\n"
"Leave the resource JSON unset for this basic setup."
msgstr ""
"这是 [Ascend Store 指南](kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-1-mooncake-"
"backend)中描述的 A3 HCCS/FabricMem 设置。对于此基础设置，请保持资源 JSON 未设置。"

msgid ""
"To use **A3 RoCE instead**, use the A2 RoCE environment block and optionally\n"
"its independent-engine block after verifying the A3 RoCE network. Disable\n"
"FabricMem by **unsetting** `ASCEND_ENABLE_USE_FABRIC_MEM`, not by assigning\n"
"`0`."
msgstr ""
"若要**改用 A3 RoCE**，请在验证 A3 RoCE 网络后使用 A2 RoCE 环境块，并可选地使用其独立引擎块。通过**取消设置** "
"`ASCEND_ENABLE_USE_FABRIC_MEM` 来禁用 FabricMem，而不是将其赋值为 `0`。"

msgid "### Optional A3 experiment: EC over HCCS, Store over RoCE"
msgstr "### 可选的 A3 实验：EC 基于 HCCS，Store 基于 RoCE"

msgid ""
"You can also try **EC/HCCS + Store/RoCE** on A3 when the participating devices\n"
"have both working HCCS and RoCE connectivity, and the installed Mooncake/HIXL\n"
"stack supports selecting the two engines' resources independently. We have\n"
"not tested this combination for this connector; treat it as an experimental\n"
"configuration rather than the validated A3 FabricMem path."
msgstr ""
"当参与的设备同时具备可用的 HCCS 和 RoCE 连接，且已安装的 Mooncake/HIXL 软件栈支持独立选择两个引擎的资源时，你也可以在 A3 "
"上尝试 **EC/HCCS + Store/RoCE**。我们尚未针对此连接器测试该组合；请将其视为实验性配置，而非经过验证的 A3 FabricMem"
" 路径。"

msgid ""
"On each Encoder, disable FabricMem and global RoCE forcing, then select the\n"
"protocol for each engine explicitly:"
msgstr "在每个 Encoder 上，禁用 FabricMem 和全局 RoCE 强制，然后为每个引擎显式选择协议："

msgid "On PD, use HCCS for its EC receive engine:"
msgstr "在 PD 上，为其 EC 接收引擎使用 HCCS："

msgid ""
"Do not enable `HCCL_INTRA_ROCE_ENABLE=1` globally for this experiment: it can\n"
"force the EC engine onto RoCE despite its HCCS resource configuration. If that software stack requires the global RoCE switch for\n"
"Store operation, use one of the earlier setups instead."
msgstr ""
"不要为此实验全局启用 `HCCL_INTRA_ROCE_ENABLE=1`：尽管 EC 引擎配置了 HCCS 资源，它仍可能强制 EC 引擎使用 "
"RoCE。如果该软件栈需要全局 RoCE 开关才能进行 Store 操作，请改用前面的一种设置。"

msgid "## 2. Start the Encoder and PD"
msgstr "## 2. 启动 Encoder 和 PD"

msgid ""
"The commands below are a small functional example, not throughput tuning.\n"
"The memory fractions and EC pool sizes must fit the selected model and device;\n"
"increase the pool if concurrent image payloads do not fit. Use real model weights\n"
"on both roles, not `--load-format dummy`, for output validation."
msgstr ""
"以下命令是一个小型功能示例，而非吞吐量调优。内存比例和 EC "
"池大小必须适配所选模型和设备；如果并发图像载荷无法容纳，请增大池。在两个角色上使用真实模型权重（而非 `--load-format "
"dummy`）进行输出验证。"

msgid ""
"Start E in its own terminal with the common environment and **one** transport\n"
"setup from step 1:"
msgstr "在单独的终端中，使用公共环境和步骤 1 中的**一种**传输设置启动 E："

msgid ""
"Start PD in another terminal with the same model and the matching transport "
"setup:"
msgstr "在另一个终端中，使用相同的模型和匹配的传输设置启动 PD："

msgid "### EC configuration fields"
msgstr "### EC 配置字段"

msgid ""
"`--ec-transfer-config` is a JSON object. Configure the following fields on each\n"
"role; `ec_connector_extra_config` holds connector-specific options:"
msgstr ""
"`--ec-transfer-config` 是一个 JSON 对象。在每个角色上配置以下字段；`ec_connector_extra_config` "
"保存连接器特定的选项："

msgid "| Field | Location | Meaning in these commands |"
msgstr "| 字段 | 位置 | 在这些命令中的含义 |"

msgid ""
"| `ec_connector` | EC config | `ECMooncakeConnector` selects the Mooncake EC"
" connector; Ascend supplies its NPU implementation. Use it on both roles. |"
msgstr ""
"| `ec_connector` | EC 配置 | `ECMooncakeConnector` 选择 Mooncake EC 连接器；昇腾提供其 "
"NPU 实现。在两个角色上都要使用它。 |"

msgid ""
"| `ec_role` | EC config | `ec_producer` encodes and sends outputs on E; "
"`ec_consumer` receives them on P/PD. |"
msgstr ""
"| `ec_role` | EC 配置 | `ec_producer` 在 E 上编码并发送输出；`ec_consumer` 在 P/PD 上接收它们。"
" |"

msgid ""
"| `ec_ip` | Consumer EC config | Local address on which the ZMQ control "
"service binds and which E uses to contact it. Use a peer-reachable address "
"across hosts. |"
msgstr ""
"| `ec_ip` | 消费者 EC 配置 | ZMQ 控制服务绑定的本地地址，也是 E 用来联系它的地址。跨主机时使用对端可达的地址。 |"

msgid ""
"| `ec_port` | Consumer EC config | ZMQ control port for the first PD worker,"
" here `19019`. E contacts it to reserve space for embeddings and obtain the "
"destination address. Other TP/DP workers use consecutive ports, as shown "
"below. |"
msgstr ""
"| `ec_port` | 消费者 EC 配置 | 第一个 PD worker 的 ZMQ 控制端口，此处为 `19019`。E 联系它以预留 "
"embedding 空间并获取目标地址。其他 TP/DP worker 使用连续端口，如下所示。 |"

msgid ""
"| `ec_buffer_device` | EC config | `npu` places the transfer pool on the "
"NPU. |"
msgstr "| `ec_buffer_device` | EC 配置 | `npu` 将传输池放置在 NPU 上。 |"

msgid ""
"| `ec_buffer_size` | EC config | Pool size in bytes: E uses it for staging "
"outgoing embeddings and Store I/O; P/PD uses it to receive embeddings. Here "
"E reserves 128 MiB and PD 256 MiB. It is separate from Store Host capacity. "
"|"
msgstr ""
"| `ec_buffer_size` | EC 配置 | 池大小（字节）：E 用它暂存发出的 embedding 和进行 Store I/O；P/PD "
"用它接收 embedding。此处 E 预留 128 MiB，PD 预留 256 MiB。它与 Store Host 容量相互独立。 |"

msgid ""
"| `ec_connector_extra_config` | EC config | Object containing transport and "
"optional Store reuse settings. |"
msgstr "| `ec_connector_extra_config` | EC 配置 | 包含传输设置和可选 Store 复用设置的对象。 |"

msgid ""
"| `mooncake_protocol` | Extra config | Set to `ascend` on both roles. "
"HCCS/RoCE/FabricMem are selected through the process environment, not by "
"changing this value to `tcp` or `rdma`. |"
msgstr ""
"| `mooncake_protocol` | 额外配置 | 在两个角色上都设置为 `ascend`。HCCS/RoCE/FabricMem "
"通过进程环境选择，而不是将此值改为 `tcp` 或 `rdma`。 |"

msgid ""
"| `control_timeout_s` | Extra config, optional | Reservation RPC timeout; "
"default 30 seconds. |"
msgstr "| `control_timeout_s` | 额外配置，可选 | 预留 RPC 超时时间；默认 30 秒。 |"

msgid ""
"| `push_wait_timeout_s` | Extra config, optional | Consumer wait for a "
"matching push; default 60 seconds. |"
msgstr "| `push_wait_timeout_s` | 额外配置，可选 | 消费者等待匹配推送的时间；默认 60 秒。 |"

msgid ""
"`--enable-mm-embeds` explicitly enables received-embedding inputs on PD.\n"
"Cross-Encoder caching requires multimodal processor caching to remain enabled;\n"
"the default already satisfies this requirement. Encoder TP/PP/DP must each be\n"
"one; these example commands use TP=1 and the default PP=1, DP=1."
msgstr ""
"`--enable-mm-embeds` 在 PD 上显式启用接收 embedding 输入。跨 Encoder "
"缓存要求多模态处理器缓存保持启用；默认设置已满足此要求。Encoder 的 TP/PP/DP 必须均为 1；这些示例命令使用 TP=1 以及默认的 "
"PP=1、DP=1。"

msgid ""
"For the single-worker example, PD listens for EC control requests on `19019`.\n"
"Its OpenAI HTTP API listens on `19537`; these are different services. The\n"
"control port handles reservations and transfer coordination, not the embedding\n"
"payload itself."
msgstr ""
"在单 worker 示例中，PD 在 `19019` 上监听 EC 控制请求。\n"
"其 OpenAI HTTP API 监听 `19537`；这是两个不同的服务。\n"
"控制端口负责预留和传输协调，而不是 embedding\n"
"负载本身。"

msgid "### Consumer TP and DP examples"
msgstr "### Consumer TP 与 DP 示例"

msgid ""
"E remains a single-device producer on device 0 with TP=1, DP=1. The examples\n"
"below replace the PD command above and the proxy command in step 3; use only\n"
"one example at a time. Each uses devices 1 and 2 for PD, so three devices are\n"
"needed in total. Apply the same model and chosen transport environment first."
msgstr ""
"E 仍然是设备 0 上的单设备生产者，TP=1、DP=1。下面的示例\n"
"将替换上面的 PD 命令以及第 3 步中的 proxy 命令；每次只使用\n"
"一个示例。每个示例都使用设备 1 和设备 2 作为 PD，因此总共需要\n"
"三个设备。请先应用相同的模型和所选的传输环境。"

msgid "#### TP=2, DP=1: one PD model split across two devices"
msgstr "#### TP=2、DP=1：一个 PD 模型拆分到两个设备"

msgid ""
"TP ranks 0 and 1 use control ports `19019` and `19020`. The proxy needs only\n"
"the TP-rank-0 address; the connector coordinates delivery to the TP workers:"
msgstr ""
"TP rank 0 和 1 使用控制端口 `19019` 和 `19020`。proxy 只需要\n"
"TP-rank-0 的地址；连接器负责协调向 TP worker 的投递："

msgid "#### TP=1, DP=2: two PD replicas"
msgstr "#### TP=1、DP=2：两个 PD 副本"

msgid ""
"DP replicas 0 and 1 use control ports `19019` and `19020`. This command exposes\n"
"one PD HTTP service on `19537`. List both replicas' EC addresses in the proxy\n"
"and set its DP size so each request and its embeddings go to the same replica:"
msgstr ""
"DP 副本 0 和 1 使用控制端口 `19019` 和 `19020`。该命令在 `19537` 上\n"
"暴露一个 PD HTTP 服务。在 proxy 中列出两个副本的 EC 地址，\n"
"并设置其 DP 大小，使每个请求及其 embedding 都发往同一个副本："

msgid ""
"In general, worker `(DP rank d, TP rank r)` listens on\n"
"`ec_port + d * TP_size + r`. For example, TP=2 and DP=2 would use:"
msgstr ""
"一般来说，worker `(DP rank d, TP rank r)` 监听\n"
"`ec_port + d * TP_size + r`。例如，TP=2 且 DP=2 时将使用："

msgid "| PD replica | TP rank 0 | TP rank 1 | Address supplied to the proxy |"
msgstr "| PD 副本 | TP rank 0 | TP rank 1 | 提供给 proxy 的地址 |"

msgid "| DP rank 0 | `19019` | `19020` | `tcp://127.0.0.1:19019` |"
msgstr "| DP rank 0 | `19019` | `19020` | `tcp://127.0.0.1:19019` |"

msgid "| DP rank 1 | `19021` | `19022` | `tcp://127.0.0.1:19021` |"
msgstr "| DP rank 1 | `19021` | `19022` | `tcp://127.0.0.1:19021` |"

msgid ""
"That combined configuration needs four PD devices plus the Encoder device.\n"
"Reserve every worker's port, but pass only one TP-rank-0 address per DP\n"
"replica to the proxy, in DP order. These addresses are separate from the\n"
"HTTP and Store ports."
msgstr ""
"该组合配置需要四个 PD 设备加上 Encoder 设备。\n"
"为每个 worker 预留端口，但按 DP 顺序只向 proxy 传递每个 DP\n"
"副本的一个 TP-rank-0 地址。这些地址与 HTTP 端口和 Store 端口\n"
"相互独立。"

msgid "Wait until both services are ready:"
msgstr "等待两个服务都就绪："

msgid "## 3. Start the proxy and send a request"
msgstr "## 3. 启动 proxy 并发送请求"

msgid "Use the proxy:"
msgstr "使用 proxy："

msgid ""
"`--ec-consumer-zmq-addrs` supplies the PD EC control addresses that the proxy\n"
"passes to the Encoder. It is an argument of that script, not a `vllm serve`\n"
"option. See the upstream\n"
"[ECMooncakeConnector usage guide](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/main/docs/features/mooncake_ec_connector_usage.md)."
msgstr ""
"`--ec-consumer-zmq-addrs` 提供 proxy 传递给 Encoder 的 PD EC 控制地址。\n"
"它是该脚本的参数，而不是 `vllm serve` 的选项。请参阅上游\n"
"[ECMooncakeConnector 使用指南](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/main/docs/features/mooncake_ec_connector_usage.md)。"

msgid ""
"The EC address must match PD's `ec_ip` and `ec_port`. Static\n"
"`--ec-consumer-zmq-addrs` supports **E + PD** with\n"
"`--prefill-servers-urls disable`; it cannot be combined with independent\n"
"prefill URLs."
msgstr ""
"EC 地址必须与 PD 的 `ec_ip` 和 `ec_port` 匹配。静态\n"
"`--ec-consumer-zmq-addrs` 在配合 `--prefill-servers-urls disable` 时\n"
"支持 **E + PD**；它不能与独立的 prefill URL 组合使用。"

msgid ""
"Send an image chat request to the proxy with any OpenAI-compatible client.\n"
"For example, the following optional `curl` request uses an HTTP image URL.\n"
"Replace the URL with an image reachable from the Encoder, and keep `MODEL`\n"
"consistent with the served model name:"
msgstr ""
"使用任意 OpenAI 兼容客户端向 proxy 发送图像聊天请求。\n"
"例如，以下可选的 `curl` 请求使用 HTTP 图像 URL。\n"
"请将该 URL 替换为 Encoder 可访问的图像，并保持 `MODEL`\n"
"与服务模型名称一致："

msgid "## 4. Enable cross-Encoder caching with Mooncake Store"
msgstr "## 4. 使用 Mooncake Store 启用跨 Encoder 缓存"

msgid ""
"Store reuse is an optional producer-side feature. Configure it only on the\n"
"Encoders; PD keeps its EC consumer configuration. For independently managed\n"
"capacity, prefer [standalone Store mode](#standalone-store-mode), following the\n"
"[upstream vLLM cross-Encoder deployment pattern](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/main/docs/features/cross_encoder_cache.md).\n"
"The embedded example below keeps storage in the Encoder processes."
msgstr ""
"Store 复用是可选的生产者侧功能。仅在 Encoder 上配置它；\n"
"PD 保持其 EC consumer 配置。对于独立管理的容量，\n"
"建议采用[独立 Store 模式](#standalone-store-mode)，遵循\n"
"[上游 vLLM 跨 Encoder 部署模式](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/main/docs/features/cross_encoder_cache.md)。\n"
"下面的嵌入式示例将存储保留在 Encoder 进程中。"

msgid "### Start a RAM Store"
msgstr "### 启动 RAM Store"

msgid "Start the master in another terminal and keep it running:"
msgstr "在另一个终端中启动 master 并保持其运行："

msgid ""
"`--port 50051` sets the master RPC listen port. Clients must use this\n"
"port in `master_server_address`. The master manages object metadata and\n"
"storage segments; it does not provide cache capacity."
msgstr ""
"`--port 50051` 设置 master RPC 监听端口。客户端必须在\n"
"`master_server_address` 中使用该端口。master 管理对象元数据和\n"
"存储段；它不提供缓存容量。"

msgid ""
"Create `mooncake_store.json` on each Encoder host or mount it into each\n"
"Encoder container:"
msgstr ""
"在每个 Encoder 主机上创建 `mooncake_store.json`，或将其挂载到每个\n"
"Encoder 容器中："

msgid ""
"In **embedded** mode, each Store client contributes `global_segment_size`\n"
"when it connects. The JSON describes that client's contribution; it does not\n"
"select which serving roles become Store clients."
msgstr ""
"在 **embedded** 模式下，每个 Store 客户端在连接时贡献\n"
"`global_segment_size`。该 JSON 描述该客户端的贡献；它并不\n"
"决定哪些服务角色成为 Store 客户端。"

msgid ""
"In this deployment, `cross_encoder_cache: true` creates an EC Store client on\n"
"each Encoder. PD uses `ec_role: \"ec_consumer\"` without cross-Encoder caching\n"
"and does not create an EC Store client. Consequently, E0 and E1 each contribute\n"
"4 GiB, for 8 GiB after both caching Encoders have started. Store chooses\n"
"the segments holding each object."
msgstr ""
"在此部署中，`cross_encoder_cache: true` 会在每个 Encoder 上创建一个 EC Store 客户端。\n"
"PD 使用 `ec_role: \"ec_consumer\"` 且不启用跨 Encoder 缓存，\n"
"因此不会创建 EC Store 客户端。因此，E0 和 E1 各贡献\n"
"4 GiB，两个缓存 Encoder 启动后共 8 GiB。Store 负责选择\n"
"存放每个对象的分段。"

msgid "| Field | Meaning |"
msgstr "| 字段 | 含义 |"

msgid "| `mode` | `embedded` for the deployment shown here. |"
msgstr "| `mode` | 此处展示的部署使用 `embedded`。 |"

msgid ""
"| `metadata_server` | `P2PHANDSHAKE` selects handshake-based TransferEngine "
"metadata exchange. |"
msgstr "| `metadata_server` | `P2PHANDSHAKE` 选择基于握手的 TransferEngine 元数据交换。 |"

msgid ""
"| `master_server_address` | Shared master address and port; use the same "
"master on all Encoders. |"
msgstr ""
"| `master_server_address` | 共享的 master 地址和端口；在所有 Encoder 上使用同一个 master。 |"

msgid ""
"| `global_segment_size` | Storage segment contributed per Store client, not "
"a cluster-wide capacity limit. |"
msgstr "| `global_segment_size` | 每个 Store 客户端贡献的存储段，不是集群范围的容量限制。 |"

msgid ""
"| `local_buffer_size` | Local buffer size in shared-engine mode. Independent"
" and FabricMem engines use an effective size of zero. Keep a positive value "
"in the JSON configuration. |"
msgstr ""
"| `local_buffer_size` | 共享引擎模式下的本地缓冲区大小。Independent 和 FabricMem 引擎的有效大小为 "
"0。请在 JSON 配置中保留正值。 |"

msgid "| `protocol` | Must be `ascend`. |"
msgstr "| `protocol` | 必须为 `ascend`。 |"

msgid ""
"| `device_name` | Empty in this example; resources are selected by the "
"transport configuration. |"
msgstr "| `device_name` | 此示例中为空；资源由传输配置选择。 |"

msgid ""
"| `enable_offload` | Must be `false`; disk offload is not supported for "
"cross-Encoder caching. |"
msgstr "| `enable_offload` | 必须为 `false`；跨 Encoder 缓存不支持磁盘卸载。 |"

msgid ""
"Local file paths may differ, but\n"
"every Encoder must connect to the same shared Store deployment."
msgstr ""
"本地文件路径可能不同，但\n"
"每个 Encoder 都必须连接到同一个共享 Store 部署。"

msgid "### Configure and restart the Encoders"
msgstr "### 配置并重启 Encoder"

msgid ""
"`MOONCAKE_CONFIG_PATH` is a **process environment variable** containing the\n"
"Store JSON file path. Export it before starting each caching Encoder:"
msgstr ""
"`MOONCAKE_CONFIG_PATH` 是一个**进程环境变量**，包含\n"
"Store JSON 文件路径。在启动每个缓存 Encoder 之前导出它："

msgid ""
"This variable connects the Encoder to Store; it does not start the master.\n"
"Keep the serving environment and the selected A2/RoCE or A3/FabricMem setup\n"
"from step 1. Restart E using the command\n"
"in step 2, replacing its entire `--ec-transfer-config` value with:"
msgstr ""
"该变量将 Encoder 连接到 Store；它不会启动 master。\n"
"保留第 1 步中的服务环境和所选的 A2/RoCE 或 A3/FabricMem 配置。\n"
"使用第 2 步中的命令重启 E，并将其整个 `--ec-transfer-config` 值替换为："

msgid ""
"The async GET budget defaults to 2 GiB; `ascend_store_get_async_bytes` is\n"
"optional and is omitted here. Set it only to change that budget."
msgstr ""
"异步 GET 预算默认为 2 GiB；`ascend_store_get_async_bytes` "
"为可选配置，此处已省略。仅在需要更改该预算时才设置它。"

msgid ""
"For a 2E + 1PD deployment, keep E0 and PD running. In another terminal,\n"
"use the same serving and Store environment, then run the Encoder command from\n"
"step 2 with the cache-enabled JSON above, changing only:"
msgstr ""
"对于 2E + 1PD 部署，保持 E0 和 PD 运行。在另一个终端中，使用相同的 serving 和 Store 环境，然后使用上述启用缓存的 "
"JSON 运行第 2 步中的 Encoder 命令，仅需更改："

msgid ""
"- `ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES=2`\n"
"- `--port 19535`"
msgstr ""
"- `ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES=2`\n"
"- `--port 19535`"

msgid "The resulting process layout is:"
msgstr "最终的进程布局如下："

msgid "| Process | Visible-device setting | HTTP port | TP / DP |"
msgstr "| 进程 | 可见设备设置 | HTTP 端口 | TP / DP |"

msgid "Restart the proxy with both Encoder URLs:"
msgstr "使用两个 Encoder URL 重启代理："

msgid "### Verify a remote cache hit"
msgstr "### 验证远程缓存命中"

msgid ""
"1. Route a request through E0 while E1 has not processed that image. Initially\n"
"   run the proxy with E0 as its only Encoder.\n"
"2. Wait for E0's `Stored encoder output in Mooncake Store` log. Publication is\n"
"   asynchronous; completion of a serving request does not acknowledge Store\n"
"   readiness.\n"
"3. Restart the proxy with E1 as its only Encoder, keeping E0 and Store running.\n"
"   Submit the identical image with the same model and preprocessing.\n"
"4. Check E1 for `encoder output(s) from Mooncake Store`. HTTP success alone\n"
"   does not prove remote reuse: a miss also succeeds by encoding.\n"
"5. Restore the two-Encoder proxy configuration for normal serving."
msgstr ""
"1. 在 E1 尚未处理该图像时，通过 E0 路由一个请求。初始时以 E0 作为唯一 Encoder 运行代理。\n"
"2. 等待 E0 输出 `Stored encoder output in Mooncake Store` 日志。发布是异步的；serving 请求完成并不表示 Store 已就绪。\n"
"3. 以 E1 作为唯一 Encoder 重启代理，同时保持 E0 和 Store 运行。使用相同的模型和预处理提交相同的图像。\n"
"4. 检查 E1 是否输出 `encoder output(s) from Mooncake Store`。仅 HTTP 成功并不能证明远程复用：未命中时通过编码同样会成功。\n"
"5. 恢复正常 serving 时，恢复双 Encoder 的代理配置。"

msgid ""
"Use the same configured model path on both Encoders for automatic multimodal\n"
"identifiers. `embedding_model_identity` changes only the model field in Store\n"
"keys; it does not by itself make different paths share content identifiers.\n"
"Change `embedding_cache_prefix` when replacing weights in place or changing\n"
"output-affecting settings. Caller-provided identifiers must consistently refer\n"
"to the same input."
msgstr ""
"在两个 Encoder 上使用相同的已配置模型路径，以获得自动生成的多模态标识符。`embedding_model_identity` 仅更改 "
"Store 键中的 model 字段；它本身并不能让不同路径共享内容标识符。在就地替换权重或更改影响输出的设置时，请更改 "
"`embedding_cache_prefix`。调用方提供的标识符必须始终指向相同的输入。"

msgid "### Store ownership and engine selection"
msgstr "### Store 所有权与引擎选择"

msgid "Storage ownership and transfer-engine ownership are separate settings:"
msgstr "存储所有权与传输引擎所有权是相互独立的设置："

msgid "| Setting | Meaning |"
msgstr "| 设置 | 含义 |"

msgid ""
"| Store `mode: \"embedded\"` | Each caching Encoder contributes its "
"configured Host storage segment. |"
msgstr "| Store `mode: \"embedded\"` | 每个启用缓存的 Encoder 贡献其配置的 Host 存储段。 |"

msgid ""
"| Store `mode: \"standalone-store\"` | Encoders contribute zero capacity; an"
" external `mooncake_client` owns the RAM pool. |"
msgstr ""
"| Store `mode: \"standalone-store\"` | Encoder 贡献零容量；由外部 `mooncake_client` "
"拥有 RAM 池。 |"

msgid ""
"| FabricMem enabled | Store creates a FabricMem engine. The EC slab remains "
"registered only with the EC engine. |"
msgstr "| 启用 FabricMem | Store 创建 FabricMem 引擎。EC slab 仍仅注册到 EC 引擎。 |"

msgid ""
"| FabricMem unset, resource JSON nonempty | Store creates an independent "
"engine; the same fixed NPU slab is registered with EC and Store. |"
msgstr ""
"| 未设置 FabricMem，resource JSON 非空 | Store 创建独立引擎；同一固定 NPU slab 同时注册到 EC 和 "
"Store。 |"

msgid ""
"| FabricMem unset, resource JSON unset | Store borrows the EC engine and its"
" slab registration. |"
msgstr "| 未设置 FabricMem，未设置 resource JSON | Store 借用 EC 引擎及其 slab 注册。 |"

msgid "### Standalone Store mode"
msgstr "### 独立 Store 模式"

msgid ""
"A separate `mooncake_client` provides the RAM pool. Keep the master and storage\n"
"process running when restarting Encoders. Data held by a storage process is\n"
"lost when that process exits."
msgstr ""
"由独立的 `mooncake_client` 提供 RAM 池。重启 Encoder 时，请保持 master "
"和存储进程运行。存储进程持有的数据在该进程退出时会丢失。"

msgid ""
"To use this mode instead of embedded storage, start the storage process below,\n"
"then replace the Encoders' Store JSON. Reuse the communication setup from\n"
"step 1. See Mooncake's [standalone deployment guide](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/blob/main/docs/source/deployment/mooncake-store-deployment-guide.md#method-c--resource-owning-real-client-mooncake_client)\n"
"for the storage process."
msgstr ""
"要使用此模式替代嵌入式存储，请先启动下面的存储进程，然后替换 Encoder 的 Store JSON。复用第 1 步中的通信设置。存储进程的配置请参见"
" Mooncake 的[独立部署指南](https://github.com/kvcache-"
"ai/Mooncake/blob/main/docs/source/deployment/mooncake-store-deployment-"
"guide.md#method-c--resource-owning-real-client-mooncake_client)。"

msgid "#### Start the master and configure the storage process"
msgstr "#### 启动 master 并配置存储进程"

msgid ""
"Run a master on the Store host, or reuse the master already running there:"
msgstr "在 Store 主机上运行 master，或复用该主机上已在运行的 master："

msgid ""
"In another terminal, start a storage process providing 16 GiB of RAM.\n"
"Replace `192.0.2.10` with the Store host IP:"
msgstr "在另一个终端中，启动一个提供 16 GiB RAM 的存储进程。将 `192.0.2.10` 替换为 Store 主机 IP："

msgid "| Argument | Meaning |"
msgstr "| 参数 | 含义 |"

msgid ""
"| `--host` | Host IP bound by the storage process; replace it with the Store"
" host address. |"
msgstr "| `--host` | 存储进程绑定的主机 IP；请将其替换为 Store 主机地址。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--port=50052` | Storage-process RPC listen port, separate from the "
"master's port 50051. |"
msgstr "| `--port=50052` | 存储进程的 RPC 监听端口，与 master 的端口 50051 分开。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--master_server_address` | Master address and RPC port to connect to. |"
msgstr "| `--master_server_address` | 要连接的 master 地址和 RPC 端口。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--metadata_server=P2PHANDSHAKE` | Exchange Transfer Engine metadata "
"through peer handshakes. |"
msgstr "| `--metadata_server=P2PHANDSHAKE` | 通过对等握手交换 Transfer Engine 元数据。 |"

msgid "| `--protocol=ascend` | Use the Ascend Transfer Engine. |"
msgstr "| `--protocol=ascend` | 使用昇腾 Transfer Engine。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--global_segment_size=17179869184` | Contribute 16 GiB of Host cache "
"capacity from this process. |"
msgstr "| `--global_segment_size=17179869184` | 由该进程贡献 16 GiB 的 Host 缓存容量。 |"

msgid "| `--enable_offload=false` | Disable SSD offload. |"
msgstr "| `--enable_offload=false` | 禁用 SSD 卸载。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--start_offload_rpc_server=false` | Do not start the SSD offload RPC "
"service. |"
msgstr "| `--start_offload_rpc_server=false` | 不启动 SSD 卸载 RPC 服务。 |"

msgid "| `--tenant_id=default` | Use the default tenant. |"
msgstr "| `--tenant_id=default` | 使用默认租户。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--threads=8` | Use eight client worker threads in the storage process. |"
msgstr "| `--threads=8` | 在存储进程中使用八个客户端工作线程。 |"

msgid "#### Connect the Encoders"
msgstr "#### 连接 Encoder"

msgid ""
"Each Encoder keeps its own transport environment from step 1 and uses this\n"
"Store JSON, replacing the example master address:"
msgstr "每个 Encoder 保留第 1 步中各自的传输环境，并使用以下 Store JSON，替换示例中的 master 地址："

msgid ""
"Replace the Store JSON configured above and restart the caching Encoders.\n"
"The vLLM `standalone-store` configuration requires `global_segment_size: 0`\n"
"on Encoders; the separate `mooncake_client` supplies the 16 GiB Host pool. The JSON's `local_buffer_size` must\n"
"still be positive. The connector passes zero local-buffer bytes to native setup\n"
"for FabricMem or independently configured Store engines; the shared-engine\n"
"path uses the configured value. Each Encoder still allocates its own NPU EC\n"
"pool, and PD keeps its existing EC consumer setup."
msgstr ""
"替换上面配置的 Store JSON 并重启启用缓存的 Encoder。vLLM 的 `standalone-store` 配置要求 Encoder "
"上的 `global_segment_size: 0`；独立的 `mooncake_client` 提供 16 GiB 的 Host 池。JSON 中的"
" `local_buffer_size` 仍必须为正数。对于 FabricMem 或独立配置的 Store "
"引擎，连接器向原生初始化传递零本地缓冲区字节；共享引擎路径则使用配置的值。每个 Encoder 仍分配自己的 NPU EC 池，PD 保持其现有的 EC"
" 消费者设置。"

msgid "## Configuration and memory sizing"
msgstr "## 配置与内存规划"

msgid "### Shared reuse"
msgstr "### 共享复用"

msgid "These options belong in each producer's `ec_connector_extra_config`:"
msgstr "以下选项应放在每个生产者的 `ec_connector_extra_config` 中："

msgid "| Option | Default | Meaning |"
msgstr "| 选项 | 默认值 | 含义 |"

msgid ""
"| `cross_encoder_cache` | `false` | Enable Store reuse and background GET "
"admission. |"
msgstr "| `cross_encoder_cache` | `false` | 启用 Store 复用和后台 GET 准入。 |"

msgid ""
"| `embedding_cache_prefix` | Empty string | Shared namespace; use the same "
"value on participating Encoders. |"
msgstr "| `embedding_cache_prefix` | 空字符串 | 共享命名空间；在参与的 Encoder 上使用相同的值。 |"

msgid ""
"| `embedding_model_identity` | Configured model path | Override the key's "
"model field; matching content identifiers are still required. |"
msgstr ""
"| `embedding_model_identity` | 已配置的模型路径 | 覆盖键中的 model 字段；仍要求内容标识符匹配。 |"

msgid ""
"| `store_max_pending_items` | `32` | Maximum pending publications per "
"Encoder; must be positive. |"
msgstr "| `store_max_pending_items` | `32` | 每个 Encoder 的最大待处理发布数；必须为正数。 |"

msgid ""
"| `store_max_pending_bytes` | `2147483648` (2 GiB) | Retained tensor-storage"
" budget for pending publications; must be positive. |"
msgstr ""
"| `store_max_pending_bytes` | `2147483648` (2 GiB) | 待处理发布保留的张量存储预算；必须为正数。 |"

msgid ""
"| `store_read_buffer_bytes` | `134217728` (128 MiB) | Maximum bytes per read"
" chunk, including object headers; must be positive. Individual objects "
"exceeding it fall back to encoding. |"
msgstr ""
"| `store_read_buffer_bytes` | `134217728` (128 MiB) | "
"每个读块的最大字节数，包括对象头；必须为正数。超过该值的单个对象将回退到编码。 |"

msgid ""
"| `ascend_store_get_async_bytes` | `2147483648` (2 GiB) | Expected payload "
"bytes admitted to background GETs until consumed or discarded. Zero admits "
"no background GETs. |"
msgstr ""
"| `ascend_store_get_async_bytes` | `2147483648` (2 GiB) | 允许进入后台 GET "
"的预期负载字节数，直到被消费或丢弃。为零时不允许任何后台 GET。 |"

msgid ""
"Background GETs run whenever shared reuse is enabled and budget is available.\n"
"The scheduler holds affected requests until results are available; misses and\n"
"recoverable read errors follow normal encoding. Objects beyond the remaining\n"
"async budget use the synchronous Store path."
msgstr ""
"只要启用了共享复用且预算可用，后台 GET 就会运行。\n"
"调度器会暂挂受影响的请求，直到结果可用；未命中和\n"
"可恢复的读取错误将走正常编码流程。超出剩余\n"
"异步预算的对象将使用同步 Store 路径。"

msgid ""
"The async byte budget is an admission limit, **not an extra allocation**.\n"
"Ascend Store PUT and GET lease regions from the producer's registered NPU\n"
"staging pool. GET chunks must also fit its aligned available capacity; lack\n"
"of a lease can cause a hit candidate to fall back to encoding. Loaded outputs\n"
"need local-cache storage, and a GET staging lease remains live until cache\n"
"copies and P2P readers finish. Size the EC pool for concurrent P2P, PUT, and\n"
"GET work, independently of Store storage segments."
msgstr ""
"异步字节预算是一个准入限制，**并非额外分配**。\n"
"Ascend Store 的 PUT 和 GET 会从生产者注册的 NPU\n"
"暂存池中租用区域。GET 块还必须适配其对齐后的可用容量；缺少\n"
"租约可能导致命中候选回退到编码。加载的输出\n"
"需要本地缓存存储，并且 GET 暂存租约在缓存\n"
"副本和 P2P 读取器完成之前会一直保持有效。请为并发的 P2P、PUT 和\n"
"GET 工作调整 EC 池大小，与 Store 存储段无关。"

msgid ""
"Pending-publication bytes, read-chunk bytes, and async-admission bytes control\n"
"different resources. Increasing one does not enlarge the EC pool or Store\n"
"capacity. Publication is best-effort and can be skipped when its budget or\n"
"staging space is unavailable."
msgstr ""
"待处理发布字节数、读块字节数和异步准入字节数控制着\n"
"不同的资源。增加其中一个并不会扩大 EC 池或 Store\n"
"容量。发布是尽力而为的，当其预算或\n"
"暂存空间不可用时可被跳过。"

msgid "## Separate prefill and decode"
msgstr "## 分离 prefill 和 decode"

msgid ""
"For E + P + D, put `ECMooncakeConnector` with `ec_role: \"ec_consumer\"` on\n"
"**P**, where embeddings are needed. Configure P-to-D KV transfer separately.\n"
"Use the upstream proxy's dynamic registration API and register `ec_zmq_addrs`\n"
"on the prefill record. The static `--ec-consumer-zmq-addrs` flag above\n"
"supports E + PD only. See the upstream\n"
"[proxy README](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/main/examples/disaggregated/disaggregated_encoder/README.md#dynamic-registration)\n"
"for registration and authentication."
msgstr ""
"对于 E + P + D，将带有 `ec_role: \"ec_consumer\"` 的 `ECMooncakeConnector` 放在\n"
"**P** 上，即需要 embeddings 的位置。单独配置 P 到 D 的 KV 传输。\n"
"使用上游 proxy 的动态注册 API，并在 prefill 记录上注册 `ec_zmq_addrs`。\n"
"上面的静态 `--ec-consumer-zmq-addrs` 标志\n"
"仅支持 E + PD。有关注册和认证，请参阅上游\n"
"[proxy README](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/main/examples/disaggregated/disaggregated_encoder/README.md#dynamic-registration)。"

msgid ""
"For Ascend P-to-D deployment, use the\n"
"[Mooncake multi-node guide](../../tutorials/features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md)\n"
"and [Ascend EPD example](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/tree/main/examples/epd_disaggregated).\n"
"Those examples are separate deployment paths; do not assume their proxy flags\n"
"implement this guide's Mooncake EC routing contract."
msgstr ""
"对于昇腾 P 到 D 部署，请使用\n"
"[Mooncake 多节点指南](../../tutorials/features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md)\n"
"和 [昇腾 EPD 示例](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/tree/main/examples/epd_disaggregated)。\n"
"这些示例是独立的部署路径；不要假设它们的 proxy 标志\n"
"实现了本指南的 Mooncake EC 路由约定。"

