msgstr ""
"- [上游 ECMooncakeConnector 文档 PR #59196](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59196)\n"
"- [上游跨 Encoder 缓存指南](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/main/docs/features/cross_encoder_cache.md)\n"
"- [昇腾 encoder-cache CPU offload](encoder_cache_cpu_offload.md)，用于通过 `ECCPUConnector` 实现共享 CPU 内存缓存。\n"
"- [单节点上的 Mooncake PD 分离](../../tutorials/features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_single_node.md)\n"
"- [跨节点的 Mooncake PD 分离](../../tutorials/features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md)"

msgid ""
"- Install compatible vLLM, vLLM Ascend, CANN, and Mooncake builds. See [Install Mooncake](../../tutorials/features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md#install-mooncake)\n"
"  for installation guidance.\n"
"- Each producer must use TP=1, PP=1, and DP=1. Scale encoding by starting\n"
"  independent producer instances.\n"
"- Reserve NPU memory for the model and EC pools, and provision Store storage\n"
"  separately for the selected transport. Tune the example pool sizes and\n"
"  memory-utilization fractions for your model and hardware.\n"
"- Ensure HTTP services, EC control addresses, and Mooncake transport endpoints\n"
"  are reachable from their peers. For cross-node and container setup, follow\n"
"  [Verify Multi-Node Communication Environment](../../tutorials/features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md#verify-multi-node-communication-environment)\n"
"  and the container instructions in that guide."
msgstr ""
"- 安装兼容的 vLLM、vLLM Ascend、CANN 和 Mooncake 构建版本。安装指导请参见 [安装 Mooncake](../../tutorials/features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md#install-mooncake)。\n"
"- 每个 producer 必须使用 TP=1、PP=1 和 DP=1。通过启动独立的 producer 实例来扩展编码能力。\n"
"- 为模型和 EC 池预留 NPU 内存，并为所选传输方式单独配置 Store 存储。请根据您的模型和硬件调整示例池大小和内存利用率比例。\n"
"- 确保 HTTP 服务、EC 控制地址和 Mooncake 传输端点可被对端访问。对于跨节点和容器环境搭建，请遵循 [验证多节点通信环境](../../tutorials/features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md#verify-multi-node-communication-environment) 以及该指南中的容器说明。"
